---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Interactive sound installations, musical robots, and instruments anyone can play. Boulder, Colorado.
---
{%- for p in collections.projects %}{% if p.data.onview %}
<a class="nowshowing" href="{{ p.url | url }}">
  <span class="nowshowing__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="nowshowing__text">
    <strong>Now showing &middot; {{ p.data.title }}</strong>
    <span class="nowshowing__sub">{{ p.data.onview.venue }} &mdash; how to play &rarr;</span>
  </span>
</a>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<header class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero__name">Instruments and experiences anyone can play.</h1>
  <p class="hero__thesis">
    Interactive installations, musical robots, and the tools to build them.
    <em>No experience required.</em>
  </p>

  {# <div class="seq" data-seq aria-label="Step sequencer — click steps to build a pattern"></div>
  <div class="seq__controls" data-seq-controls>
    <button class="seq__btn" type="button" data-seq-mute aria-pressed="false">Sound off</button>
    <span class="seq__label">Click the steps &mdash; it plays</span>
  </div> #}
</header>

<section class="sec">
  <p class="sec__label">Work — filter by kind</p>

  <div class="filters" data-filters>
    <button class="filter" type="button" data-kind="" aria-pressed="true">all</button>
    {%- for kind in collections.kinds %}
    <button class="filter" type="button" data-kind="{{ kind }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ kind }}</button>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="grid" data-grid>
    {%- for p in collections.projects %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ p.url | url }}" data-kinds="{{ p.data.kinds | kindList }}">
      {% thumb p.fileSlug, p.data.title, p.data.focus %}
      <div class="card__meta">{% if p.data.onview %}<span class="card__onview">On view</span> &middot; {% endif %}{{ p.data.year }} &middot; {{ p.data.kinds[0] }}</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">{{ p.data.title }}</h3>
      <p class="card__tagline">{{ p.data.tagline }}</p>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="empty" data-empty hidden>Nothing tagged that — yet.</p>
</section>
